{"last_link_id": 4, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [525.2734375, 219.49880981445312], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [-1188.4735107421875, 1198.356689453125], "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "id": 6, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#ad2efc", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "left", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 11, "backgroundAlpha": 0.25, "lineHeight": 1.4, "text": "视频导入说明\n\n• video：选择要放大的源视频。先上传或放入 input 目录后，在这里选择。\n• force_rate：强制帧率。0 表示保持原视频帧率；只有需要统一为 24 / 25 / 30 fps 时再填写。\n• force_size：导入时是否强制改分辨率。通常选 Disabled，避免在放大前重复缩放。\n• custom_width / custom_height：仅当 force_size 选 Custom 时生效。一般保持 0。\n• frame_load_cap：最多读取的帧数。0 为完整读取；测试时可设 30 或 60，加快出图。\n• skip_first_frames：跳过片头的帧数。0 为不跳过。\n• select_every_nth：抽帧间隔。1 为逐帧处理；2 为每两帧取一帧，会降低流畅度。\n• format：解码兼容格式。保持当前 LTXV，遇兼容问题再改。\n• meta_batch / vae：高级可选输入。普通 MP4 放大不用连接；超长视频分批或潜空间视频时才需要。", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#fcfcfc"}, "order": 0}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [488.7415771484375, 276.24505615234375], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [-158.76597595214844, 1193.5186767578125], "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "id": 8, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#ad2efc", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "left", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 11, "backgroundAlpha": 0.25, "lineHeight": 1.4, "text": "视频合成与输出说明\n\n• images：接收 RTX 放大后的图像帧，已自动连接。\n• audio：接回原视频音频；不连接会输出静音视频。\n• meta_batch / vae：高级可选输入。普通 MP4 无需连接。\n• frame_rate：输出帧率。建议与源视频保持一致，避免音画不同步、画面加速或减速。\n• loop_count：循环次数。0 为不循环；主要用于 GIF，普通 MP4 保持 0。\n• filename_prefix：输出文件名前缀。建议用“项目名_分辨率”等清晰命名。\n• format：输出封装与编码。video/h264-mp4 兼容性最好，适合剪映、B站和大多数播放器。\n• pingpong：正放后倒放。普通视频关闭，仅循环动图需要时开启。\n• save_output：是否保存到 output 目录。正式输出必须开启。\n• no_preview：是否关闭预览。长视频或界面卡顿时可开启。\n• pix_fmt：像素格式。yuv420p 兼容性最高；yuv420p10le 为 10-bit，需要剪辑软件支持。\n• crf：H.264 画质控制，数值越小越清晰、文件越大。推荐 19；常用范围 17–23。\n• save_metadata：保存工作流参数，建议开启，便于以后复现。\n• trim_to_audio：按音频长度裁切。只有音画时长不一致时才开启。", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#fcfcfc"}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "bgcolor": "transparent", "size": [156.78945922851562, 44.80699157714844], "color": "#fff0", "pos": [-619.1865844726562, 727.4517822265625], "inputs": [], "flags": {"allow_interaction": true}, "id": 5, "type": "孤海注释", "properties": {"padding": 12, "backgroundColor": "#ad2efc", "borderRadius": 20, "textAlign": "center", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "fontSize": 24, "backgroundAlpha": 0.25, "lineHeight": 1.4, "text": "3840 2160", "stroke": true, "fontColor": "#fcfcfc"}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [{"name": "upscaled_images", "links": [2], "label": "upscaled_images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "upscaled_images"}], "color": "#20e863", "widgets_values": ["target dimensions", 3840, 2160, "ULTRA"], "inputs": [{"name": "images", "link": 1, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"widget": {"name": "resize_type"}, "name": "resize_type", "label": "resize_type", "type": "COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3", "localized_name": "resize_type"}, {"widget": {"name": "resize_type.width"}, "name": "resize_type.width", "label": "resize_type.width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "resize_type.height"}, "name": "resize_type.height", "label": "resize_type.height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"widget": {"name": "quality"}, "name": "quality", "label": "quality", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quality"}], "flags": {}, "type": "RTXVideoSuperResolution", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#0cd44f", "size": [218.37948608398438, 130], "pos": [-634.2693481445312, 571.2966918945312], "id": 1, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfyui_nvidia_rtx_nodes", "ver": "f13f030c3173aeaa9aeb092177716b4300038814", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.7"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"resize_type.height": true, "resize_type": true, "resize_type.width": true, "quality": true}, "